      "id": "p0025-b001",
      "kind": "caption",
      "source": {
        "text": "This Japanese line features a strong \"rural, country bumpkin\" speech pattern. The localized line, despite being in a completely different language, uses a roughly similar English dialect to provide the same vibe and details that would've otherwise been lost in a literal translation (Game: Blaster Master Zero 2)",
