      "kind": "caption",
      "source": {
        "text": "~ In the Japanese Animal Crossing games, Mr. Resetti speaks with a very thick Osaka dialect. Because this dialect doesn't exist in English, the localization team approximated it by giving him a distinctive, gruff New York accent instead",
