    {
      "id": "p0025-b004",
      "kind": "caption",
      "source": {
        "text": "If a bilingual character sometimes speaks a foreign language, a literal translation of their dialogue into that foreign language will flatten their speech and effectively turn the character monolingual (Game: Tokimeki Memorial)",
